msgid "Change page every (seconds)"
msgstr "页面切换间隔（秒）"

msgid "Change pages automatically"
msgstr "自动轮播页面"

msgid "Check how the router reaches the internet and view its internet and local network addresses."
msgstr "查看路由器的联网方式，以及互联网和本地网络地址。"

msgid "Check whether ScreenPlus is working normally or refresh it after troubleshooting."
msgstr "检查 ScreenPlus 是否正常运行，或在排查问题后刷新服务。"

msgid "Choose an image smaller than 10 MB."
msgstr "请选择小于 10 MB 的图片。"

msgid "Choose both an on and off time for %s."
msgstr "请同时为%s选择开启和关闭时间。"

msgid "Choose how the page settles into place after you lift your finger."
msgstr "选择手指离开后页面如何完成切换。"

msgid "Choose how the screen looks, responds to touch and protects your Wi-Fi password."
msgstr "设置屏幕显示、触摸操作和 Wi-Fi 密码保护方式。"

msgid "Choose one fixed picture behind all page content, or a separate picture that moves with each page. Images are centre-cropped to 284 × 76 px and applied immediately."
msgstr "可选择固定在所有页面内容下方的同一张图片，或为每个页面设置随页面移动的独立图片。图片会居中裁切为 284 × 76 像素并立即应用。"

