msgstr "无法保存背景图片。"

msgid "The connection is enabled and linked, but cannot reach the internet."
msgstr "连接已启用且链路正常，但无法访问互联网。"

msgid "The connection or device is available, but is not currently enabled."
msgstr "已检测到连接或设备，但当前未启用。"

msgid "The custom background has been removed."
msgstr "自定义背景已移除。"

msgid "The screen stays on only during the selected time ranges. The schedule repeats every week."
msgstr "屏幕仅在选定时段内亮起，定时设置每周循环。"

msgid "The screen turns off after this much time without a touch."
msgstr "在这段时间内没有触摸操作时，屏幕将自动关闭。"

msgid "The upload choices below change with this setting. Uploading a picture also selects its matching style."
msgstr "下方的上传选项会随此设置变化；上传图片时也会自动选择对应的背景模式。"

