msgid "Turn off a row to keep the screen off for those days. An end time earlier than the start continues past midnight; equal times mean all day."
msgstr "关闭某一行可让对应日期全天息屏。结束时间早于开始时间表示跨越午夜；两个时间相同表示全天亮屏。"

msgid "Turn off after (seconds)"
msgstr "空闲后息屏（秒）"

msgid "Turn this off to use the original GL.iNet screen."
msgstr "关闭后将使用 GL.iNet 官方屏幕服务。"

msgid "Upload and download speed"
msgstr "上行和下行速率"

